# Surgical Suite: "When you unlock this door, return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the
# battlefield." Cast as its left door in turn 3 with Bot1's graveyard holding Cut Down (not a creature), Hired Blade and
# Goblin Piker (both creatures of mana value 3 or less, discarded to Faithless Looting) and Bot2's Ornithopter (a creature card
# in an opponent's graveyard, killed by Cut Down): Cut Down and Bot2's Ornithopter are refused, Hired Blade is chosen and enters
# untapped under Bot1's control; Goblin Piker stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Cut Down
Faithless Looting
Surgical Suite // Hospital Room
Hired Blade
Plains
Goblin Piker
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cut Down.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Goblin Piker; Hired Blade)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Surgical Suite // Hospital Room.Cast(Ability: Surgical Suite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Cut Down)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Graveyard.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Hired Blade)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Hired Blade.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Hired Blade.SummoningSick = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Goblin Piker; Cut Down
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Surgical Suite.Doors = Surgical Suite
